    {
      "source": "Derby requires an additional column to be used for the insert since it is impossible\nto insert a null into the identity column and have the value generated.  This is solved by\nproviding the name of a dummy column that also must be created in the sequence table.",
      "translation": "Derby 需要额外使用一列来进行插入，因为无法向标识列插入空值并生成该值。此问题通过提供一个虚拟列的名称来解决，该名称也必须在序列表中创建相应的列。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Thanks to Endre Stolsvik for the suggestion!",
      "translation": "感谢 Endre Stolsvik 的建议！",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
